stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED: 学生提交
    CREATED --> ASSIGNED: 管理员派单
    CREATED --> CANCELLED: 学生或管理员取消
    ASSIGNED --> ASSIGNED: 管理员改派
    ASSIGNED --> PROCESSING: 当前维修工接单
    ASSIGNED --> CANCELLED: 管理员取消
    PROCESSING --> DONE: 当前维修工提交完成
    DONE --> CLOSED: 报修学生确认
    DONE --> PROCESSING: 报修学生驳回
    CLOSED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
